window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Jennifer Foxray is a badass MMA fighter. When she finds herself kidnapped and brought into another dimension, her skills are an asset. Arrows whizzing past her head? No problem. She'll still kick major goblin backside. She can take care of herself and save her friends. She doesn't need a man to save her. Nope. Not even if he's hot enough to melt her resistance.</p> <p>Hyz is on a quest, with his trusty horse Thunder. He needs to know if the rumors of impending war are true. His plans come to halt when he comes across the most gorgeous woman on the planet, fighting off a horde of goblins. Though she can clearly hold her own, Hyz steps in to save her. That's what heroes do. His saber toothed tiger wants her for a mate and Hyz is definitely attracted to her. But she can't be his. He must wait for the woman with the glowing rock.</p> <p>It's a good thing Jenn doesn't do relationships, because her rock isn't glowing at the moment. Plus, she has two best friends to find and Hyz's world to save. And really who has time for tingly girl parts and feelings when there's butt to kick and a battle to destroy the evil creatures trying to take control of Crystal Kingdom?</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
